1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maren Johanne Mamen, born 12 March 1808 in Rakkestad, Østfold, Norway, married Jens Bjerch Aschehoug on 13 October 1826 at the Fredrikshald Church in Halden, Østfold, Norway. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Various spellings of Bjerch are Bjerck, Bierch, and Bjerk. Aschehoug has also been spelled Aschehaug by some descendants of Jens Bjerck Aschehaug.
2 CONT
2 CONT Maren Mamen Aschehoug died on 11 October 1837 at the Kråkstad Parish parsonage, Norway, where her husband Jens Bjerch was the Sogneprest (Provst).
