1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Trafikdirektör
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Cathrinus Nicolai Arbo Collett''' (1841-1921), was a railway engineer and is considered to be the founder of the Swedish branch of the Collett family.  He married Josephine Lucie Holmsen who was born on 27.10.1853.  Cathrinus d
2 CONC ied on 12.04.1921 followed four years later by Josephine on 28.06.1925.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife: [http://www.geni.com/people/Josefine-Lucie-Collett/5165835278890074870 Josephine Lucie Holmsen]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Peter-Collett/5165935248080122845 Peter John James Collett] - 18.10.1873
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Agnes-Collett/6000000000905991599 Agnes Collett] - 10.04.1875
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Carl-Collett/6000000000905991616 Carl Albert Collett] - 17.10.1877
2 CONT # [http://www.geni.com/people/Alice-Maria-Sofia-Sch%C3%B8nmeyr/5165999459350085358 Alice Maria Sophia Collett] - 03.09.1878
2 CONT
2 CONT Svensk biografi på [http://runeberg.org/spg/17/0065.html Svenskt porträttgalleri] : "Stud. vid Polytechnicum i Hannover 59; afg.-ex. 64. Nivellör vid Ystad—Eslöfs järnvägsbyggnad 64—65; anst. vid Würtembergska statsbanorna 65—67; 
2 CONC assistent o. sednare chef vid Norska statsbanornas undersökningar 67—72; stationsingeniör o. sednare distriktsingeniör vid Stora bergslagsbanans byggnad 72—80; trafikchef vid Nora  —Karlskoga järnvägsaktiebolag 80—1903."
2 CONT
