1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://data.eidsvollsmenn.no/tng/getperson.php?personID=I30604&tree=Eidsvollsmenn
2 CONT
2 CONT Delegate in Eidsvoll and signatory of the Norwegian Constitution 17 May 1814.  District Governor of Hedmark 1804-1816. Overrets-Justitarius in Kristiansand.
2 CONT ======================
2 CONT Anton Claus? Inspekt. Grønland 1797-1803, Amtm. (?) i Hedmark 1814. Høysterettsdommer (?) i Kristiansand, Amtmann (?) 1815, Bosatt i Vang, HE.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sønner : 
2 CONT - Abraham (1809-1894 Hamar), g. 1841 m. Katherine Ibsen f.1819,  (barn: Claus f.1842, g.m. Katherine Kitzer (1841-1901), Fredrik f.1848 (lege), g.1881 m. Hanna Augusta Evensen),  - Christian Fredrik (1815-1862 Frosta), g. 1847 m. 
2 CONC Margrethe Christiane Hansmond (?) Brun,  (4 barn: Claus Dominicus f.1849, Magda Christiane f.1848, g.m. Jens Caspar Tornoe (1843-1888),  Amelia Kathinka (1807-1864), g.m. Conrad Møller, Louise Fredrika f.1811),  - Louise Fredrikke
2 CONC  (bosatt i Moss i 1843). ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ 5 barn : i) Amelia (Amalie) Kathinka (Cathrine ?) (1807-64), g.m. Conrad Møller,  ii) Abraham Andreas (13/9-1809-1894 Hamar), g. 12/11-1841 m. Anna Katherine Ibsen f. 21/1-181
2 CONC 9, 3 barn:  1) Claus Lars, b.Nov. 15, 1842, married Katherine Kitzer (1841-1901), 2 children: Henry b.1866 and Andrew (1873-1925).  Andrew married Hannah Mueller (1875-1968), 2 children:  - Alberta Grace (1904-1983), married Georg
2 CONC e Wildprett, no children,  - Charles Herman (1907-Oct 26, 1972) , married Edith Bauer July 4, 1941, she died August.16,1988, one child:  - Gail Linda Bendeke, born April 8, 1945, married Philip Johnson, b. June 4, 1942, on June 10
2 CONC , 1967, 2 children:  a) Lynn Michelle born August 13, 1970, married Andrew Davies in 2003, born Aug. 3, 1958, b) Eric Charles Johnson, born Nov. 30, 1975.  2) Fredrik Bendeke (1848-1915), married Hanna Evensen in 1888, 5 children:
2 CONC   a) Jacob died 1913, b) Kathinka, born 1882, married Peter Paulsen, c) Andrea (1885-1914), d) Roar, born 1890 married Nellie (Nov. 30, 1898-1982)  (Nellie had a son Leif by a previous marriage), e) Gudrun, born 1892, married Half
2 CONC dan Olsen, one child: Unn, married twice: Owinch Killan and Iver Svenning.  3) Aline Bendeke, born 1851, married Jacob Roll (1848-1890).  iii) Louise Fredrikke f. 1810, bosatt i Moss i 1843, iv) Antonette b. 1811, v) Christian Fre
2 CONC drik (1815 Vang-1862 Frosta),  g. 1847 m. Margrethe Christiane Hammond Brun (1817 Surnadal-1883 Stord), 2 barn:  Magda Christiane f.1848, g.m. Jens Caspar Tornøe (1843-88), Claus Dominicus f.1849, vi) Johanna Margarethe Lintrop [?
2 CONC ] Bendeke (Nov. 16, 1817 - 1856).
