1 NAME Carl Nielsen /Coch/
2 GIVN Carl Nielsen
2 _MARNM Coch
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 12 SEP 1750
2 ADDR
3 CITY Hitterdal
1 BAPM
2 DATE 16 SEP 1750
2 PLAC Heddal Stavkirke
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE 14 NOV 1828
