1 NAME Kaja Eide Norena
1 NAME Kaja Andrea Karoline /Hansen/
2 GIVN Kaja Andrea Karoline
2 SURN Hansen
2 _MARNM Eide
1 NAME Kaja Eide Norena
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 26 APR 1884
2 ADDR
3 CITY Karljohansvern, Horten
3 STAE Vestfold
3 CTRY Norway
1 BAPM
2 DATE 18 MAY 1884
