1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bernhard Lambrechts was baptized on 24 Sep 1828 at the Oslo Domkirke. He married Karin Bolette Marie Aschehoug at the Rakkestad church in Østfold, Norway, on 27 Nov 1855. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The children born to Bernhard during his marriages include the two sons from his marriage to Karin Bolette Marie Aschehoug, sometimes spelled Aschehaug (Thorstein Gabriel Jens Aschehoug Lambrechts and Ragnar Frederick Lambrechts).
2 CONC  His second marriage, to Ellen Marie (Melia) Møller, brought about four children (Hakon; Bernhard who was called Bern, Barry, or Barney,; Froidis Frances, the only girl; and Thorfin).  No children are listed for his third marriage
2 CONC . 
2 CONT
