2 CONT Henrik Thorsnæs <http://digitalarkivet.arkivverket.no/en-gb/ft/person/pf01036441005342>	20.02.1885	Aas	hf ug Bestyrer av pleie- og arbeidshjem	Østre Toten: Billerud (gaard)	Folketelling 1910 for 0528 Østre Toten herred
2 CONT
2 CONT He was at this time unmarried and Manager of the nursing and work home Østre Toten. 
2 CONT Later he became the manager of the farm Skjerven in Larval, Vestfold. While working there he met 
2 CONT  Magnhild Lovise Grette whom he married in 1931. As she was the heiress to the farm Boserud in Sandsvær, Kongsberg, he lived and worked there since then until his death.
