1 NAME Emil /Collett/
2 GIVN Emil
2 SURN Collett
2 _MARNM Collett
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Vestre Gravlund
2 ADDR
3 CITY Oslo
3 CTRY Norway
1 BIRT
2 DATE 22 NOV 1875
